WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.180
 My takeaway from today are the interchangeable terms such as first premolar and first bicuspid.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:13.920
 My takeaway from today was that you purge your water and air line for 20 to 30 seconds

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.600
 between patients.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.880
 My takeaway from today is that you don't sanitize your room, you disinfect it.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:24.320
 Is that you must use one hand to recap the needle.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:29.120
 My takeaway from today is understanding where to put the topical anesthesia on the maxillary

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.640
 arch and the mandibular arch.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:37.080
 My takeaway so far is every tooth has a mesial and a distal surface.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:41.880
 My biggest takeaway is that wearing gloves when cleaning a room means you're dirty.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:50.040
 My takeaway from today was learning how to recap with the one hand scoop technique and

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.400
 then from last class it was learning the surfaces of the teeth.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.320
 My takeaway from today was learning how to sterilize instruments.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:05.740
 My biggest takeaway is that you use the blue needle for the maxillary and then you use

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.520
 the yellow needle for the mandibular.

